/*
 * EmitDecl.h.ct - the declaration / trait / impl-surface writers
 * (SH-94 S1a-1 Phase D5, completed by the v1-PH-2 S8 tail).
 *
 * The globals, trait declarations, link externs, vtable / Drop visibility,
 * unit initialiser, `emit_type_decl` with its six `em_decl_*` kind slices,
 * `emit_impls` and the instance / closure / ADT glue they call moved here.
 * Every body is byte-identical to the one Emitter.h.ct held; the `Emitter`
 * type and the `EmitDecl` declarations live in EmitterCore.h.ct, so this unit
 * imports Core and the sibling emit units, and the import graph stays acyclic
 * (Host -> EmitShell, EmitDecl -> {EmitHeader, EmitExpr}).
 *
 * License: same as the rest of the compiler (see LICENSE / LICENSE.EXCEPTION).
 */

